sentences.text:
Learned counsel for the appellant assails the impugned Award only on ground of quantum submitting that;
a) compensation as awarded to the claimants is on higher side;
b) admittedly the deceased was a labourer at the time of death and therefore, learned Tribunal has erred in adding future prospects at the rate of 50% whereas the same ought to have been 40%;
c) amounts granted under conventional heads are also on higher side;
d) each of the claimants has been awarded Rs.1,00,000/- towards consortium whereas it should be Rs.40,000/- each.
4.

